+---
+type: fix
+jira: SMILE-12000
+title: "Per-resource `$expunge` now removes all `HFJ_RES_LINK` rows referencing the expunged resource (as source or target) before deleting the `HFJ_RESOURCE` row, preventing `FK_RESLINK_SOURCE` and `FK_RESLINK_TARGET` constraint violations (HAPI-2415)."
